{"text":"purananuru","n":248,"lines":["அளிய தாமே சிறுவெள் ளாம்பல்","இளையம் ஆகத் தழையா யினவே இனியே","பெருவளக் கொழுநன் மாய்ந்தெனப் பொழுது மறுத்து","இன்னா வைகல் உண்ணும்","அல்லிப் படுஉம் புல் ஆயினவே"],"tr":["aḷiya tāmē ciṟuveḷ ḷāmpal","iḷaiyam ākat taḻaiyā yiṉavē iṉiyē","peruvaḷak koḻunaṉ māynteṉap poḻutu maṟuttu","iṉṉā vaikal uṇṇum","allip paṭuum pul āyiṉavē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"potuviyal","tinai_ta":"பொதுவியல்","turai_ta":"தாபதநிலை","poet_ta":"ஒக்கூர் மாசாத்தனார்","poet_tr":"Okkūr Mācāttaṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 17, veṇcīr 2"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 9, veṇṭaḷai 8, kalittaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"அளிய","tr":"aḷiya","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அளி","tr":"aḷi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ய","tr":"ya"}]},{"text":"தாமே","tr":"tāmē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தா","tr":"tā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மே","tr":"mē"}]},{"text":"சிறுவெள்","tr":"ciṟuveḷ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"சிறு","tr":"ciṟu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வெள்","tr":"veḷ"}]},{"text":"ளாம்ப","tr":"ḷāmpa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளாம்","tr":"ḷām"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ப","tr":"pa"}]}],[{"text":"லிளையமாகத்","tr":"liḷaiyamākat","foot":"karuviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"லிளை","tr":"liḷai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யமா","tr":"yamā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கத்","tr":"kat"}]},{"text":"தழையா","tr":"taḻaiyā","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தழை","tr":"taḻai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"}]},{"text":"யினவே","tr":"yiṉavē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"யின","tr":"yiṉa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"}]},{"text":"யினியே","tr":"yiṉiyē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"யினி","tr":"yiṉi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யே","tr":"yē"}]}],[{"text":"பெருவளக்","tr":"peruvaḷak","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெரு","tr":"peru"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வளக்","tr":"vaḷak"}]},{"text":"கொழுநன்","tr":"koḻunaṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கொழு","tr":"koḻu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"நன்","tr":"naṉ"}]},{"text":"மாய்ந்தெனப்","tr":"māynteṉap","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மாய்ந்","tr":"māyn"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தெனப்","tr":"teṉap"}]},{"text":"பொழுதுமறுத்","tr":"poḻutumaṟut","foot":"karuviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பொழு","tr":"poḻu"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தும","tr":"tuma"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றுத்","tr":"ṟut"}]}],[{"text":"தின்னா","tr":"tiṉṉā","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தின்","tr":"tiṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னா","tr":"ṉā"}]},{"text":"வைக","tr":"vaika","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வை","tr":"vai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"க","tr":"ka"}]},{"text":"லுண்ணு","tr":"luṇṇu","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"லுண்","tr":"luṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணு","tr":"ṇu"}]}],[{"text":"மல்லிப்","tr":"mallip","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மல்","tr":"mal"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லிப்","tr":"lip"}]},{"text":"படுவும்","tr":"paṭuvum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"படு","tr":"paṭu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வும்","tr":"vum"}]},{"text":"புல்லா","tr":"pullā","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"புல்","tr":"pul"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லா","tr":"lā"}]},{"text":"யினவே","tr":"yiṉavē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"யின","tr":"yiṉa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"அளிய","parts":[{"text":"அளிய","lemma":"அளி","gloss":"pitiable"}],"gloss":"pitiable"},{"surface":"தாமே","parts":[{"text":"தாம்","lemma":"தாம்","gloss":"they"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"indeed they"},{"surface":"சிறு","parts":[{"text":"சிறு","lemma":"சிறு","gloss":"small"}],"gloss":"small"},{"surface":"வெள்","parts":[{"text":"வெள்","lemma":"வெள்","gloss":"white"}],"gloss":"white"},{"surface":"ஆம்பல்","parts":[{"text":"ஆம்பல்","lemma":"ஆம்பல்","gloss":"water-lily"}],"gloss":"water-lily"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இளையம்","parts":[{"text":"இளையம்","lemma":"இளையம்","gloss":"we were young"}],"gloss":"we were young","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஆக","parts":[{"text":"ஆகு","lemma":"ஆகு","gloss":"to become"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"as"}],"gloss":"as we were"},{"surface":"தழை","parts":[{"text":"தழை","lemma":"தழை","gloss":"foliage garment"}],"gloss":"foliage garment"},{"surface":"ஆயினவே","parts":[{"text":"ஆயின","lemma":"ஆகு","gloss":"became"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"they became indeed"},{"surface":"இனியே","parts":[{"text":"இனி","lemma":"இனி","gloss":"now"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"now indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பெரு","parts":[{"text":"பெரு","lemma":"பெரு","gloss":"great"}],"gloss":"great"},{"surface":"வள","parts":[{"text":"வள","lemma":"வள","gloss":"wealth"}],"gloss":"wealth","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கொழுநன்","parts":[{"text":"கொழுநன்","lemma":"கொழுநன்","gloss":"husband"}],"gloss":"husband"},{"surface":"மாய்ந்தென","parts":[{"text":"மாய்ந்தென","lemma":"மாய்ந்தென","gloss":"since he died"}],"gloss":"since he died","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பொழுது","parts":[{"text":"பொழுது","lemma":"பொழுது","gloss":"time"}],"gloss":"time"},{"surface":"மறுத்து","parts":[{"text":"மறுத்து","lemma":"மறு","gloss":"restricting"}],"gloss":"restricting"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இன்னா","parts":[{"text":"இன்னா","lemma":"இன்னா","gloss":"painful"}],"gloss":"painful"},{"surface":"வைகல்","parts":[{"text":"வைகல்","lemma":"வைகல்","gloss":"days"}],"gloss":"days"},{"surface":"உண்ணும்","parts":[{"text":"உண்","lemma":"உண்","gloss":"to eat"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"eating"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அல்லி","parts":[{"text":"அல்லி","lemma":"அல்லி","gloss":"lily petals"}],"gloss":"lily petals"},{"surface":"படுஉம்","parts":[{"text":"படுஉம்","lemma":"படுஉம்","gloss":"which is obtained"}],"gloss":"which is obtained","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"புல்","parts":[{"text":"புல்","lemma":"புல்","gloss":"meager food"}],"gloss":"meager food"},{"surface":"ஆயினவே","parts":[{"text":"ஆயின","lemma":"ஆகு","gloss":"became"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"they became indeed"}]}],"literal":"Pitiable indeed are they, the small white water-lilies! / When we were young, they became foliage garments; but now, / since the husband of great wealth died, restricting the times of meals, / during these painful days, the eating / lily-derived meager food they have become.","translation":"How pitiable they are, those small white water-lilies! When we were young, they served as our beautiful foliage garments. But now, since my husband of great wealth has passed away, they have become the meager food gathered from lily seeds, eaten only at restricted times during these miserable days of widowhood.","modern":"சிறிய வெண்மையான ஆம்பல் மலர்கள் மிகவும் இரங்கத்தக்கவை. நாம் இளமையாக இருந்த காலத்தில் அவை நமக்கு ஆடையாகவோ அணிகலனாகவோ பயன்பட்டன. ஆனால் இப்பொழுது, மிகுந்த செல்வத்தை உடைய கணவன் இறந்துவிட்டதால், பொழுதுகளை மறுத்து, துன்பம் தரும் இந்நாட்களில் உண்ணும் அல்லி மலரிலிருந்து பெறப்படும் எளிய உணவாக அவை மாறிவிட்டன.","explanation":"This poem is spoken by a grieving widow who reflects on her drastically changed life after her husband's death. In her youth, the small white water-lilies were used joyfully as decorative foliage garments during happy times with her husband. Now, in her state of ascetic widowhood (tāpatanilai), those same lilies have become her meager, restricted diet. She must skip regular meals and eat only the simple lily seeds or petals to survive these painful days. The contrast between the lilies as ornaments of youth and lilies as the food of sorrow highlights the harsh reality of her loss. This poignant transition underscores the theme of impermanence and the austere life forced upon widows in ancient society.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.5],[0.5,0.8],[0.88,1.3],[1.75,2.2],[2.35,2.5],[2.5,2.9],[2.9,3.0],[3.0,3.4],[3.4,4.33],[4.33,4.33],[4.33,4.33],[4.33,4.7],[4.7,6.6],[6.6,7.1],[7.1,7.3],[7.3,7.7],[7.7,8.7],[8.7,8.8],[8.8,9.2],[9.2,9.3]],"female":[[0.0,0.4],[0.5,0.9],[0.9,1.1],[1.15,1.4],[1.4,2.3],[2.6,2.9],[2.9,3.3],[3.3,3.4],[3.4,3.8],[3.8,5.0],[5.0,5.6],[5.6,5.9],[5.9,6.6],[6.6,6.8],[6.8,7.7],[7.7,7.9],[7.9,8.3],[8.3,9.4],[9.4,9.5],[9.5,9.9],[9.9,10.0]]}}